# Secret paths every TCOS repo excludes. Data, not code: hee-check reads this
# file, so adding a pattern here reaches every repo without editing a tool.
#
# Deliberately narrow. A baseline that matches too much gets negated back by
# whoever it inconveniences, and a negation is what published a credential in
# pr:609@human-execution-engine.
secrets/
.hee/secrets/
*.env
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
.netrc
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
